These are some of the most important numbers that every programmer should know. The second(Power of 2s) and 3rd(time units in terms of seconds) are quite obvious but I like to keep them in place so that I can remember them quickly. However, the most important one is Jeff Dean&rsquo;s numbers. Here we go:
Jeff Dean&rsquo;s Numbers Credits - https://gist.github.com/jboner/2841832
